<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Connect started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Connect started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Joseph J. Farley said he initiated coverage of Connect Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that as one of the earliest viable players on scene in the Internet sales channel software market, CNKT is poised to capitalize on and continue penetrating this market's significant opportunity,&quot; Farley said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/16 at 6-9/16.</p>
